          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa mulandu wakuti Kafundisha ali na mano, kanshi ena abikilepofye ukulafundako abantu ifyakukwata amano. Alepelulwila no kufwaya fwaya no kuwamya amapinda ayengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kafundisha alifwailishe bwino amashiwi ayalinga, nefyo alembele fyali ifyalungama kabili ifyacishinka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Insoselo sha bantu bamano shaba ishatwa nge cimuti icasongoka. Insoselo shabo shaba nge nsunga ishapampaminwa kabili ishaikashiwa, ishafuma kuli kacema umo mpo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We mwana wandi ulecenjela ku fyakulundwako kuli ifi. Uleishiba nokuti imilimo yakulemba ifitabo taingapwa nakalya, no kusambilila apakalamba nako kulanasha umuntu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
